OL,3,AWhat is going on with Poundland?
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe future of Poundland hangs in the
OL,6,Fbalance as it faces a possible collapse
OL,7,Finto administration.
OL,9,FIts owner, US investment firm Gordon
OL,10,FBrothers, put it up for sale in
OL,11,FSeptember, but then rejected offers to
OL,12,Fkeep the business afloat.
OL,14,FPoundland has a major presence on the
OL,15,FHigh Street, with 600 stores in the UK
OL,16,Fand Ireland, where it trades under the
OL,17,FDealz brand.
OL,19,FIf it were to collapse, the jobs of its
OL,20,F11,000 employees would be at risk, as
OL,21,Fwell as potentially thousands of others
OL,22,Fat firms that supply the retailer.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
